"#practice"><span class="st-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 12a8 8 0 0 1-11.6 7.1L4 20l1-4.6A8 8 0 1 1 21 12z"/></svg></span><small>I have a tricky student tomorrow</small><b>Rehearse the conversation</b><p>Pick a situation card or bring your own case, and get step-by-step AI feedback in about 3 minutes.</p><span class="st-go">Try it right below ↓</span></a><a class="st-card rv" href="stories.html"><span class="st-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="m10 8 6 4-6 4z"/></svg></span><small>Does it really work?</small><b>See real classroom cases</b><p>Teacher–student dialogues, and how students actually changed.</p><span class="st-go">See the cases →</span></a><a class="st-card rv" href="approach.html"><span class="st-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="m7 15 4-4 3 3 5-6"/></svg></span><small>I want to understand it</small><b>Learn the method</b><p>The coordinate plane of consciousness, the three solutions and the 3S Questioning Method on one page.</p><span class="st-go">Read the method →</span></a></div></div></section><section class="fz-sec" id="plane"><div class="wrap"><div class="fz-plane pl2">
<div class="rv pl-text"><span class="fz-tag">THE COORDINATE PLANE OF CONSCIOUSNESS</span><h2 class="h-plane">What you choose sends<br><em class="nw">consciousness up or down</em></h2>
<div class="fz-head" style="margin:0"><p>The <b>x-axis</b> represents ‘action’ driven by good thoughts, and the <b>y-axis</b> represents ‘consciousness’ grown through those actions. Depending on the choices (+, −) you make in every encounter, your consciousness rises into the Plus Zone or falls into the Minus Zone.</p></div></div>
