><g class="fork" style="--d:6.4s"><path d="M374 135l40 -30" stroke="#2945BE" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="5 5"/><path d="M374 135l40 30" stroke="#D9655A" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="5 5"/><text x="418" y="105" font-size="20" font-weight="900" fill="#2945BE">+</text><text x="418" y="175" font-size="20" font-weight="900" fill="#D9655A">−</text></g><line class="seg" pathLength="1" x1="374" y1="135" x2="450" y2="70" stroke="#2945BE" style="--d:7.0s"/><circle class="fade" cx="450" cy="70" r="5.5" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#2945BE" stroke-width="3" style="--d:7.6s"/><circle class="fade" cx="70" cy="250" r="7" fill="#1E2A5A" style="--d:0s"/><text class="fade" x="70" y="276" text-anchor="middle" font-size="18" font-weight="800" fill="#1E2A5A" style="--d:.2s">Encounter</text><text class="fade" x="88" y="112" font-size="18" font-weight="800" fill="#5D4FC4" style="--d:.8s">Momentary choice = dy/dx</text><text class="fade" x="295" y="243" text-anchor="middle" font-size="18" font-weight="800" fill="#D9655A" style="--d:5.4s">Change in slope (− → +)</text><text class="fade" x="398" y="214" text-anchor="middle" font-size="18" font-weight="900" fill="#1E2A5A" style="--d:8.2s">Integration (∫)</text><circle class="glow" cx="450" cy="70" r="14" fill="#2945BE" style="--d:8.6s;--o:.35"/><circle class="fade" cx="450" cy="70" r="7" fill="#2945BE" style="--d:8.6s"/><text class="fade" x="434" y="64" text-anchor="end" font-size="18" font-weight="900" fill="#1E2A5A" style="--d:8.6s">Growth of consciousness</text></svg><div class="lc-bar"><button class="lc-replay" type="button">Replay ↻</button></div></figure>
<p class="fz-formula pl-formula rv"><span class="fl">The Calculus of Life</span><span class="fm">Every momentary choice (dy/dx) accumulates (∫) to shape the trajectory of your entire life.</span><span class="fw" aria-hidden="true">∫</span></p>
<div class="fz-zones pl-zones rv">
<div class="fz-zone plus"><div class="zl">Plus (+)<i>ZONE</i></div><p>Truthfulness, honesty, sincerity, diligence, love, consideration, understanding, forgiveness. No matter how hard it gets, never go back to Minus; choose Plus again.</p></div>
<div class="fz-zone"><div class="zl">Zero (0)<i>ZONE</i></div><p>Neither love nor hate—no change (+1−1=0). Good deeds without reflection leave consciousness unchanged.</p></div>
<div class="fz-zone minus"><div class="zl">Minus (−)<i>ZONE</i></div><p>Lies, deception, laziness, hatred, resentment, complaining, arrogance. Blaming circumstances (“I ended up like this because of that”), you keep choosing Minus.</p></div>
</div><p class="zone-note wide rv">Plus, Zero and Minus are not labels for a child or for feelings; they are standards for reflecting on our thoughts and choices in the moment. We do not divide feelings into good or bad—we help children understand their feelings and then choose their next thoughts and actions for themselves.</p></div></div></section><section class="fz-sec alt" id="solutions"><div class="wrap">
<div class="fz-head c rv"><span class="fz-tag"><b class="stp">STEP 1 · UNDERSTAND</b>THREE SOLUTIONS</span><h2>The power to choose Plus<br><em>every time life tests you</em></h2></div>
<div class="sg rv"><article class="sg-card"><span class="no">SOLUTION I</span><h3>Higher Growth</h3><p>Reflect on (differentiate) your thoughts and actions in each encounter, and if they were Minus, turn them into Plus in practice. Those choices add up and consciousness grows.</p><div class="sg-vis sg-flow"><figure class="hg-flow"><svg class="hg-wide" viewBox="0 0 1000 300" role="img" font-family="Noto Sans KR, Noto Sans CJK KR, Apple SD Gothic Neo, Malgun Gothic, sans-serif" aria-label="Higher Growth flow: encounter → thoughts and actions (differentiate) → if Plus, go to practice and integration of life (∫); if Zero or Minus, choose Plus with a change in slope (− → +), then go to practice and integration of life (∫) → growth of consciousness (Higher Growth)"><defs><marker id="hgw-g" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="#2945BE"/></marker><marker id="hgw-r" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="#D9655A"/></marker><marker id="hgw-n" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="#6F7994"/></marker></defs><rect x="10" y="115" width="140" height="70" rx="12" fill="#E9ECF2" stroke="#6F7994" stroke-width="2.5"/><text x="80.0" y="156.1" text-anchor="middle" font-size="17" font-weight="700" fill="#3A3F4C">Encounter</text><rect x="190" y="110" width="175" height="80" rx="12" fill="#E7EAF1" stroke="#5D4FC4" stroke-width="2.5"/><text x="277.5" y="134.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="17" font-weight="700" fill="#5D4FC4">Differentiate</text><text x="277.5" y="156.1" text-anchor="middle" font-size="17" font-weight="700" fill="#5D4FC4">Thoughts and</text><text x="277.5" y="178.2" text-anchor="middle" font-size="17" font-weight="700" fill="#5D4FC4">Actions</text><line x1="150" y1="150" x2="182" y2="150" 