<!-- 영상 2: data-yt="" 안에 유튜브 주소(또는 영상 ID)를 넣으세요 -->
<article class="vcard" data-yt="llZJcNx_XmM"><button class="vplay" type="button" style="background-image:url(video2-poster.jpg)" aria-label="Play video: Case 2"><span class="vicon" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="vsoon">Coming soon</span></button><div class="vtxt"><span class="vno">CASE 2</span><b>A Teacher’s Apology That Led to Reconciliation</b><p>By apologizing for a hasty judgment and hearing both sides, the teacher helped two students see their mistakes and make up.</p></div></article>
